WEBVTT

00:06:29.197 --> 00:06:31.397
not high achievement.

00:06:32.297 --> 00:06:36.330
So let yourself be mediocre
at whatever you're trying to do,

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:38.630
but be mediocre every day.

00:06:38.963 --> 00:06:40.897
Take only one step,

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:43.763
but take that step every day.

00:06:44.497 --> 00:06:46.197
If your better-than-nothing habit

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:48.730
doesn't actually seem
better than doing nothing,

00:06:48.763 --> 00:06:51.530
consider that you're
getting started at something

00:06:51.563 --> 00:06:56.397
and that initiating a behavior
is often the hardest part.

00:06:57.130 --> 00:06:58.397
By getting started,

00:06:58.397 --> 00:07:01.363
we're establishing
the neural pathway in our brain